<section name=\"about\"><section class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-12\"><div data-aos=\"fade-up\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold\">About Me</h1><p class=\"text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6\">Hello! I’m <span class=\"font-semibold\">Naimul</span>, a passionate Frontend Developer. My journey into web development started from a curiosity about how the websites I use every day are made. I wanted to create experiences that are not only visually appealing but also meaningful and easy to use.<br/><br/>Over time, that curiosity grew into a deep passion for building interactive, modern, and responsive web applications. I enjoy solving problems and bringing creative ideas to life through code. For me, web development is the perfect balance of creativity and logic.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-12\">My Skills</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-7 gap-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"HTML\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/html-1.svg\"/><span>HTML</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"CSS\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/css-3.svg\"/><span>CSS</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Tailwind CSS\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/tailwind-css-2.svg\"/><span>Tailwind CSS</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"JavaScript\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/logo-javascript.svg\"/><span>JavaScript</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"React\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/react-2.svg\"/><span>React</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Firebase\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/firebase-1.svg\"/><span>Firebase</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Node.js\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"bg-white p-1 rounded-xl\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/nodejs-icon.svg\"/><span>Node.js</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Express.js\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"bg-white p-1 rounded-xl\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/express/express-original.svg\"/><span>Express.js</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"MongoDB\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded-xl\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://www.vectorlogo.zone/logos/mongodb/mongodb-icon.svg\"/><span>MongoDB</span></div></div></div></section></section><section name=\"portfolio\"><section id=\"projects\" class=\"py-16 bg-black\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-white\">My Projects</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"md:basis-[61.8%] flex-shrink-0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ksmYbbdj/Screenshot-2025-08-13-192129.png\" alt=\"Social-Events-Platform\" class=\"w-full h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-purple-500/40\"/></div><div class=\"md:basis-[38.2%] max-w-lg\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">Social-Events-Platform</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A modern event management platform that allows users to create, join, and explore local or online events. Built with a responsive UI and real-time event updates to enhance community engagement.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">React</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Node.js</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Express</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">MongoDB</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-400\"><li>Real-Time Event Radar - See parties and meetups near you as they happen (no more FOMO!)</li><li>1-Click RSVP - Secure your spot faster than you can say &#x27;I&#x27;m in!&#x27;</li><li> Social Buzz Feed - Share moments and connect with other attendees before the event</li></ul><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:underline text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold\" href=\"https://social-event.netlify.app/\">View Live Project →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 md:flex-row-reverse\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"md:basis-[61.8%] flex-shrink-0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TDxYbFyJ/Screenshot-2025-08-13-192939.png\" alt=\"Freelance-Task\" class=\"w-full h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-purple-500/40\"/></div><div class=\"md:basis-[38.2%] max-w-lg\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">Freelance-Task</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A freelance marketplace that connects clients with freelancers. Features job posting, bidding, and task tracking to ensure smooth collaboration between both parties.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">React</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Express.js</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">jwt</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-400\"><li>Post and manage freelance jobs</li><li>Bid and track project progress</li><li>User profile creation and portfolio display</li></ul><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:underline text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold\" href=\"https://freelance-task-2323.netlify.app/\">View Live Project →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 \" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)\"><div class=\"md:basis-[61.8%] flex-shrink-0\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tMT1cnVq/Screenshot-2025-08-13-192729.png\" alt=\"Forum-Platform\" class=\"w-full h-72 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-purple-500/40\"/></div><div class=\"md:basis-[38.2%] max-w-lg\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white\">Forum-Platform</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A community-driven blogging and discussion platform where users can share articles, comment, and interact within topic-specific categories.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">React</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Firebase</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Express.js</span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">Firebase </span><span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-slate-400 text-white text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm\">stripe</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-sm text-gray-400\"><li>Clean, User-Friendly Interface</li><li>The forum has a minimalist design with intuitive navigation, making it easy for users to browse threads, post content, and engage in discussions without clutter.</li><li>Markdown Support</li><li>The platform supports Markdown formatting, allowing users to create well-structured posts with headings, lists, code blocks, and other styling options for better readability.</li><li>Responsive &amp; Fast Performance</li><li>Built with modern web technologies (likely Svelte/SvelteKit), the forum loads quickly and works seamlessly across devices, from desktops to mobile phones.</li></ul><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hover:underline text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold\" href=\"https://s-forum-b.netlify.app/\">View Live Project →</a></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section name=\"contact\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold  text-center mb-12\">Contact Me</h1><section class=\"    lg:flex    flex-col items-center px-4\"><div data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-duration=\"3000\" class=\"container mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12\"><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2\"><div><form class=\" p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded mb-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2  \" name=\"name\" value=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" required=\"\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded mb-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 \" name=\"email\" value=\"\"/><textarea name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Your Message\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\" class=\"w-full p-3 border rounded mb-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 \"></textarea><button type=\"submit\" class=\"  px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-white font-semibold  hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-400/20 transition\" tabindex=\"0\">Send Message</button></form></div></div><div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2\"><div data-aos=\"\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-200 space-y-8\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold\">I<!-- --> <span><span></span><span style=\"color:inherit\" class=\"styles-module_blinkingCursor__yugAC styles-module_blinking__9VXRT\">_</span></span></h1><ul class=\"space-y-6 text-lg\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"text-red-500 text-2xl\" height=\"1em\"